  "proof": "Gate publication bit is set only after successful OnceLock.set. Each real notification and binding use AcqRel fetch_or on one sticky AtomicU32. Atomic RMW modification order makes the later RMW read all earlier bits; acquire/release synchronizes the earlier reason or preceding initialized gate, including intervening RMW release sequences. Notification-first forces bind to invalidate; bind-first forces notification to observe initialized gate and invalidate. Both cannot miss. Closed-only reasons invalidate; any ordinary cumulative reason fails. InitialValidation/batch never erase these bits. Failed or double bind cannot replace retained gate; each monitor has distinct gate. cfg(test) pause parameters/waits are absent in non-test callback build.",
  "tests_added": [
    "paused_first_notification_and_first_bind_cannot_both_miss_invalidation",
    "prebind_reasons_and_failed_second_bind_preserve_sticky_exact_gate",
    "unbound_notification_handshake_and_batching_allocate_zero"
  ],
